==Galician==
{{wikipedia|lang=gl}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|gl|vío}}

===Etymology===
Either derived of akin to {{der|gl|LL.|vibia||t=crosspiece}} which was probably borrowed from {{der|gl|cel-gau|-}}; if just akin, then from a local {{der|gl|cel|-}} *''vibio-'', from {{der|gl|ine-pro|*weh₁y-|t=to twist, to twine}}.<ref>{{R:DCECH|vena}}</ref> Cognate with {{cog|pt|veio}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbeo̝/|/ˈbeʊ̯/|lang=gl}}

===Noun===
{{gl-noun|m}}

# [[crosspiece]]
# part of the [[vertical]] [[axis]] of a water mill
# [[peg]] under the bed of the cart used for tying and securing the load
# [[lever]], [[crank]]
# [[plaited]] [[frame]] used to protect a [[haymound]]
# each one of the [[twigs]] used to plait that frame
# [[axis]] of the [[reel]]

